---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Delete your account"
  description="How to permanently delete your InkMagnet account and all associated data."
>
  <p>
    You can permanently delete your InkMagnet account and all data associated
    with it at any time. Deletion is irreversible.
  </p>

  <h2>What gets deleted</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>your account (email, name, sign-in credentials),</li>
    <li>all your book projects, their content, images and generated files,</li>
    <li>notifications and in-app activity.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Records of completed payments are retained only as long as required by
    accounting and tax law, then removed.
  </p>

  <h2>How to delete your account</h2>
  <p>
    Send an email to
    <a href="mailto:contact@inkmagnet.com?subject=Account%20deletion%20request">contact@inkmagnet.com</a>
    <strong>from the email address of the account you want deleted</strong>, with
    the subject "Account deletion request". We verify the sender address and
    delete the account within 7 days, confirming by reply.
  </p>
  <p>
    Deleting the InkMagnet app from your device does not delete your account —
    use the email request above.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
